# Java Refactoring Suite for Neovim

IntelliJ IDEA-style refactoring tools for Java in Neovim, using Treesitter and Telescope.

## Features

### Extract Interface (Implemented)

Extract public methods and constants from a Java class into a new interface.

**Keybinding:** `<leader>jr` (in Java files)

**Workflow:**
1. Place cursor anywhere in your Java class
2. Press `<leader>jr`
3. Interactive Telescope prompts will guide you through:
   - Interface name (smart suggestions based on class name)
   - Package selection (defaults to current package)
   - Member selection (multi-select public methods and constants)
   - JavaDoc handling (as-is, copy, or move)

**Features:**
- ✅ Smart interface naming (strips "Impl", "Service" suffixes)
- ✅ Extracts public methods
- ✅ Extracts public static final fields (constants)
- ✅ Handles JavaDoc comments
- ✅ Automatically updates class to implement interface
- ✅ Adds @Override annotations to methods
- ✅ Opens generated interface in vsplit
- ✅ Formats generated code

## Usage Example

**Before (StripePaymentService.java):**
```java
package dev.quietghost.store;

public class StripePaymentService {
  public static final String PROVIDER = "Stripe";
  
  /**
   * Process payment
   */
  public void processPayment(double amount) {
    System.out.println("STRIPE: " + amount);
  }
}
```

**After refactoring:**

**PaymentService.java** (new interface):
```java
package dev.quietghost.store;

public interface PaymentService {
  String PROVIDER = "Stripe";
  
  /**
   * Process payment
   */
  void processPayment(double amount);
}
```

**StripePaymentService.java** (updated):
```java
package dev.quietghost.store;

public class StripePaymentService implements PaymentService {
  public static final String PROVIDER = "Stripe";
  
  /**
   * Process payment
   */
  @Override
  public void processPayment(double amount) {
    System.out.println("STRIPE: " + amount);
  }
}
```

## Dependencies

- ✅ nvim-treesitter (with Java parser)
- ✅ telescope.nvim
- ✅ plenary.nvim

## File Structure

```
lua/refactoring/
├── init.lua                      # Entry point
├── extract_interface.lua         # Extract interface implementation
├── parsers/
│   └── java_parser.lua          # Treesitter Java parsing utilities
├── generators/
│   └── interface_generator.lua  # Interface code generation
├── ui/
│   └── telescope_prompts.lua    # Telescope UI prompts
└── utils/
    └── naming.lua               # Smart naming heuristics
```

